-- Migration 111: West Creek Reservation singletrack loops as trail POIs.
-- Geometry and difficulty: OpenStreetMap (ODbL 1.0), ways tagged path=mtb, fetched 2026-10-31.
-- mtb:scale:imba 1/2/3 maps to easy/moderate/difficult. Names carry "West Creek" because
-- "Gorge Loop Trail" (#1015) is at Bedford and the rest are too generic to collect on.
-- No status_url: Metroparks reports one status for the whole system, on the trailhead (#5683).

